# Symbian OS 10.1 FP2 / Nokia Belle FP2 (701 RM-774 113.010.1506 EUser.dll; the 808 RM-807 113.010.1508 has the
# same) executive call numbering -> our kernel. Derived from personalities/sym101/exec.map (Belle Refresh) by
# matching every EUser export that reaches one call in both firmwares (249 calls, none ambiguous; tools/swi_map.py
# reports in build/roms/<id>/<fw>/abi): the fast calls are unchanged; FP2 adds S11, S12 and Sd8 (no export reaches
# them: unmapped, logged), Belle's Sd6 (ThreadGetHeap) and Sd7 (ThreadAsProcess) have no FP2 slot left (no export
# reaches them either), so Belle S11..Sd5 are FP2 S13..Sd7 and Belle Sd8..S114 are FP2 Sd9..S115.
